1
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,547
=Episode 3=

3
00:00:49,547 --> 00:00:51,555
(Please Wait Outside the Operating Room)

4
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:01,111
Ye Shen.

5
00:01:01,111 --> 00:01:02,400
(Countdown to Death)

6
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,520
I'm so sleepy.

7
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:05,525
Just sleep.

8
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:07,560
I'll always stay by your side.

9
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:26,376
Ye Shen.

10
00:01:30,235 --> 00:01:36,433
(Two Hours Before the Wedding)

11
00:01:41,680 --> 00:01:43,000
So it's an endless reset, huh?

12
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,640
Well, let's see then.

13
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:48,200
Whether you're torturing me,

14
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:49,720
or I'm torturing you.

15
00:01:58,040 --> 00:01:59,069
Gu Xiaotang.

16
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,760
Are you insane?

17
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,496
Wedding dress.

18
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,840
You want me to wear the wedding dress?

19
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,852
What are you doing?

20
00:02:19,141 --> 00:02:20,199
I'll wear it!

21
00:02:23,929 --> 00:02:24,955
Wear it!

22
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:26,408
Wear it!

23
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:28,280
I'll wear it! Wear it!

24
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,347
Wear it!

25
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:31,040
Wear it!

26
00:02:31,040 --> 00:02:32,158
Wear it!

27
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:45,960
Xiao... Xiaotang.

28
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,024
- Xiaotang, I...
- What are you doing here?

29
00:02:47,720 --> 00:02:49,280
Is there a Ye Shen on the guest list?

30
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:51,075
What?

31
00:02:52,760 --> 00:02:53,886
Who?

32
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,480
You? Do you know Ye Shen?

33
00:02:55,480 --> 00:02:57,071
What Ye? Actually, Lu Qingyuan and I...

34
00:02:57,071 --> 00:02:58,600
I see. Go ahead.

35
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:00,587
Gu Xiaotang!

36
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:01,880
Don't go!

37
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,622
Who is Ye Shen?

38
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,280
Have you been cheating on me all along?

39
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,640
You're disgusting.

40
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,240
Stop!

41
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,760
You'll stay till you tell me who he is!

42
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,120
- Gu Xiaotang
- Let go of me.

43
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,520
Why are you so slow this time?

44
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,520
Who is he? Is he that other man?

45
00:03:30,840 --> 00:03:31,976
Let's talk somewhere else.

46
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,611
This place disgusts me.

47
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,120
Babe, are you okay?

48
00:03:45,998 --> 00:03:47,141
Get lost!

49
00:03:48,440 --> 00:03:50,680
Ye Shen, what's going on here?

50
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:52,320
Last time, I just fell asleep.

51
00:03:52,320 --> 00:03:53,840
Why did the loop start again?

52
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,920
- Tell me.
- You did fall asleep.

53
00:03:57,920 --> 00:03:59,480
But after you entered deep sleep,

54
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:01,320
your heartbeat stopped.

55
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:06,800
- What did you say?
- It seems

56
00:04:06,800 --> 00:04:08,880
that death isn't the only way
to trigger the loop.

57
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:11,240
The loop also starts
when you lose consciousness.

58
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:13,440
So in this loop,

59
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,160
I don't even
deserve a good night's sleep.

60
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:20,497
You're right.

61
00:04:21,480 --> 00:04:23,000
If we don't break this loop,

62
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:24,761
everything will be in vain.

63
00:04:27,200 --> 00:04:28,256
Fine.

64
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:29,720
In that case,

65
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:32,360
I'm going off-script.

66
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:33,920
You mean...

67
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,760
Since this loop is tied to this wedding,

68
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,520
I'll just escape from it.

69
00:04:38,280 --> 00:04:39,339
It will be hard.

70
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:40,680
With so many people here,

71
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:41,840
leaving quietly

72
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:42,920
is simply impossible.

73
00:04:44,840 --> 00:04:46,440
Who said I'm going to leave quietly?

74
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,840
If I am to leave,

75
00:04:47,840 --> 00:04:49,800
I'll make it spectacular.

76
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,360
I want everyone to see

77
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:53,360
how I shake off this pile of mud.

78
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:57,160
Still haven't found her.

79
00:04:57,960 --> 00:04:59,280
Has anyone seen where she is?

80
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:01,200
- No.
- Useless!

81
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,960
What is Gu Xiaotang up to?

82
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,280
She's not bailing on us, is she?

83
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:08,040
Marrying into the Lu family
is already a huge honor,

84
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,200
and she dares to vanish?

85
00:05:09,600 --> 00:05:10,920
I think it's a publicity stunt.

86
00:05:12,440 --> 00:05:14,897
- He had to pick some nobody influencer.
- Exactly.

87
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:16,440
Looking for me?

88
00:05:28,170 --> 00:05:29,560
Isn't that Gu Xiaotang?

89
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:30,800
Why isn't she in her dress?

90
00:06:12,160 --> 00:06:14,520
Everyone, sorry to keep you waiting.

91
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:16,240
I just went to change my outfit.

92
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,640
After all,

93
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,480
I've been looping so many times,

94
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,080
so I want to try something new.

95
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,680
Gu Xiaotang, this is haute couture!

96
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,626
You're done for.

97
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:29,080
Do you all think

98
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:30,440
that I have gone crazy?

99
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,050
Let me tell you.

100
00:06:32,240 --> 00:06:33,360
No one is clearer than me.

101
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,520
Because I've seen this play out

102
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,880
a million times.

103
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:40,640
Lu Qingyuan,

104
00:06:40,640 --> 00:06:42,280
how many times have I caught

105
00:06:42,640 --> 00:06:43,680
you and Xia Na cheating?

106
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:45,360
I can't even count anymore.

107
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:48,400
Director Li,
no matter how many times we restart,

108
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:49,960
you always use the same tricks on me.

109
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:51,600
Aren't you tired of it?

110
00:06:54,120 --> 00:06:55,320
And you too, Mrs. Lu.

111
00:06:55,960 --> 00:06:57,640
The way you lie on the operating table,

112
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,280
waiting to harvest my kidney,

113
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:02,360
doesn't look like a noble lady at all.

114
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:04,486
Really?

115
00:07:05,213 --> 00:07:07,160
What nonsense are you talking about?

116
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:09,320
How could you say Lu Qingyuan and I

117
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:11,200
have been caught by you so many times?

118
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,480
Do you have any proof?

119
00:07:13,357 --> 00:07:14,520
If you keep talking nonsense,

120
00:07:15,240 --> 00:07:16,600
I'll sue you for slander.

121
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:17,960
How did I use tricks on you?

122
00:07:17,960 --> 00:07:19,200
I'm helping you.

123
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:24,040
No one's admitting it, huh?

124
00:07:26,040 --> 00:07:27,283
Ye Shen!

125
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:30,906
Who's he?

126
00:07:31,280 --> 00:07:32,541
Who is this man?

127
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:41,989
It's you,

128
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,760
the thug who just beat me up.

129
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,240
You dare to come here?

130
00:07:47,640 --> 00:07:48,960
Do you want to die?

131
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,320
You don't dare to admit your affair.

132
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:53,680
I'll admit it. That's right.

133
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,480
Ye Shen is my lover.

134
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:57,133
Isn't he attractive?

135
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,880
- Lover?
- Lover?

136
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,200
Since you already had someone else,

137
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,560
why did you agree
to marry into the Lu family?

138
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:08,720
You humiliate the Lu family like this.

139
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,733
What do you really want?

140
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,400
You've got it wrong, Mrs. Lu.

141
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,160
I want the Lu family.

142
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,120
Lu Qingyuan,

143
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,120
you cheated on me,

144
00:08:17,120 --> 00:08:18,520
and still play the loving couple.

145
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:20,261
You love to act so much.

146
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:21,480
I'll act with you then.

147
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:23,160
I

148
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:24,840
will marry you today anyway.

149
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:26,440
Not only will I be Mrs. Lu,

150
00:08:26,880 --> 00:08:28,600
I'm going to spend your money,

151
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,840
live off your fortune,

152
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:32,240
and use your wealth

153
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,400
to keep my lover.

154
00:08:33,800 --> 00:08:36,200
I'll put the greenest cuckold's crown
right on your head.

155
00:08:36,680 --> 00:08:37,852
You...

156
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:39,080
What's that look?

157
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,040
One rule for you,

158
00:08:41,040 --> 00:08:42,200
another for us?

159
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,400
And you.

160
00:08:47,400 --> 00:08:49,120
Aren't you in poor health?

161
00:08:49,120 --> 00:08:50,240
Don't worry.

162
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,600
I will definitely

163
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:53,040
take very good care of you.

164
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,720
I'll make sure
that every day from now on,

165
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,280
you'll wish you were dead,

166
00:08:57,600 --> 00:08:58,600
but I won't let you.

167
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:01,880
Emcee!

168
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,240
The wedding continues.

169
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,680
Don't listen to her.

170
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,880
Gu Xiaotang,
you just drag some random guy

171
00:09:10,880 --> 00:09:12,800
and say he's your man?

172
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:14,240
Do you think we're all idiots?

173
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:16,349
Don't believe her, everyone.

174
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,360
She's just doing this for publicity.

175
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:19,880
Seeing the Lu family's decline,

176
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,040
you found a pretty boy

177
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:23,320
to put on a show of rebelling for love,

178
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:29,240
just to extend
your influencer career, right?

179
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,760
Miss Gu,

180
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,080
can you prove your relationship?

181
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,280
Mr. Ye, how did you two meet?

182
00:09:36,665 --> 00:09:38,520
Are they just doing this for publicity?

183
00:09:39,487 --> 00:09:41,200
We've been best friends
for so many years.

184
00:09:41,680 --> 00:09:43,120
How could I not know

185
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,320
if you have a boyfriend?

186
00:09:44,880 --> 00:09:45,960
I guess

187
00:09:45,960 --> 00:09:47,280
you don't even know

188
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,320
where he lives, right?

189
00:09:48,668 --> 00:09:49,760
This is fraud.

190
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:51,200
I'm calling the police.

191
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,269
You're done for.

192
00:09:56,897 --> 00:09:58,040
Gu Xiaotang.

193
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:03,280
You just brought some random man here,

194
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:05,440
trying to blackmail the Lu family.

195
00:10:05,810 --> 00:10:07,720
I'll sue you for marriage fraud.

196
00:11:11,367 --> 00:11:14,723
♪The face deep in the heart♪

197
00:11:14,915 --> 00:11:17,377
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

198
00:11:18,752 --> 00:11:22,452
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

199
00:11:22,663 --> 00:11:25,103
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

200
00:11:25,250 --> 00:11:27,622
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

201
00:11:27,772 --> 00:11:30,529
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

202
00:11:30,529 --> 00:11:32,850
♪Even for just a second♪

203
00:11:34,195 --> 00:11:37,658
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

204
00:11:37,786 --> 00:11:39,635
♪And sunlight reverses♪

205
00:11:39,635 --> 00:11:43,105
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

206
00:11:43,461 --> 00:11:45,535
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

207
00:11:46,037 --> 00:11:49,446
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

208
00:11:49,703 --> 00:11:54,915
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

209
00:11:56,169 --> 00:11:58,734
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

210
00:11:58,776 --> 00:12:02,229
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

211
00:12:02,806 --> 00:12:05,769
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

212
00:12:06,514 --> 00:12:09,122
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

213
00:12:09,122 --> 00:12:12,745
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

214
00:12:13,215 --> 00:12:17,271
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
